<aside class="note" aria-label="R290 refrigerant note">
  <p><strong>R290 refrigerant.</strong> This model uses R290 (propane), a natural refrigerant with very low global warming potential. R290 is flammable, so installation follows the applicable Singapore requirements for equipment using flammable refrigerants, including SCDF guidance and IEC 60335-2-40. Installation is carried out by trained installers. <a href="/safety-compliance/">Read about safety and compliance</a>.</p>
</aside>
